    "text": "The number of solutions of the equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cot</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>cot</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cosec</mi><mi>x</mi></math> in <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,10</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is/are",
