  "correctValue": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> lies in <math><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msup></math> or <math><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></msup></math> quadrant then <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></math> thus equation becomes<br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> not possible<br />If <math><mi>x</mi></math> lies in <math><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></msup></math> or <math><msup><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msup></math> quadrant, then <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></math> thus equation becomes<br /><math><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>∵</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> is the only solution<br />(In <math><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></msup></math> quad.)<br />In <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;there is only one solution<br />In <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,10</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, we get, five&nbsp;solutions",
